            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article attempts to concisely present some of the scientific basis of the pharmacology of anti-inflammatory medications. The clinical use and application of anti-inflammatories is also addressed. The information is designed to assist the clinician to develop a sound approach in selecting the appropriate treatment plan for their patients.</AbstractText>
